    <string name="cyt_look_desc_default">A black background with four apps along the bottom.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_aurora">A deep blue background with a soft glow behind the apps.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_six_columns">Six apps across, so more fit on the screen.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_cinema">Velvet curtains around a dark stage, and the focused app\'s name in large type.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_console">Seven small tiles, a big app name and deep cobalt light.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_horizon">Mountain ridges under a sky that changes with the hour: blue by day, warm at sunrise and sunset, dark at night.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_quiet">Pure black, no picture and calm motion. Good for OLED and slower TVs.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_diwali">Lamps, a gold rangoli and festive icons, until 10 November.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_library">Every app on one calm page like a bookshelf: no dock band, warm lamp light.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_arcade">A neon sun over a glowing grid, six tiles a row that bounce when you move.</string>
    <string name="cyt_look_desc_mist">Soft out of focus light in indigo, teal and peach, calm like a streaming box at night.</string>
